{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/4a043ecb8cfe1f88779bbdd98e1b246a.poster.avif?t=1771514119\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/4a043ecb8cfe1f88779bbdd98e1b246a.webm?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/4a043ecb8cfe1f88779bbdd98e1b246a.mp4?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rejoice humans! The most watched Fame Show Arena Roguelike on the interdimensional cable is here. Show off your build crafting creativity, please the Gods to earn their ungodly powers and fight your way up to Stardom in this cartoony killfest for consenting adults.<br><br>'Cause you're no longer just a fighter, <strong>you're a Star.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/4d625ce4b8e6f61d479d97bd3a70b5d3.avif?t=1771514119\" width=700 height=77 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the favor of a God, grow stronger, and expand your divine brand accross dimensions. Weapons, skills, power-ups\u2014everything is a product the Gods are advertising, the more famous you become the cooler gear you get to brag about. So make their products shine and rise to become the disgustingly rich celeb you secretly dream to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.poster.avif?t=1771514119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.webm?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.mp4?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/6993c4bf64dffb3826e7dfebb35c3c29.avif?t=1771514119\" width=700 height=77 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon death you\u2019ll revive in the Backstage, where you must check in with your AI-Gent, shake on the shadiest deals and romance an NPC or two to gain followers and unleash your God\u2019s Gifts.<br><br>Fight through the levels and violent TV events where ratings are all that matters, Rival contenders will get in your way, defeat them, steal their followers and sacrifice them to your God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.poster.avif?t=1771514119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.webm?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/3be5f54e0931e52f7b2674e2ecaca881.mp4?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/cb6497f6ae5431ccdaff368a1a144a6e.avif?t=1771514119\" width=700 height=77 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road to Stardom won\u2019t be easy, master your Gifts, unlock Signature Weapons, expand your fanbase to absurd limits on your path to become the GodsTV GOAST (Greatest of All Space Time, duh!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.poster.avif?t=1771514119\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.webm?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.mp4?t=1771514119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2626570?t=1771514119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/dd3ee76cb6ff198391b8c7b3a8752f042880f694/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771514119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/75d88521844e32c1f3f7bda59c61d89c3f0a3310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771514119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626570/75d88521844e32c1f3f7bda59c61d89c3f0a3310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771514119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragr